            "source_id": "eval_river",
            "start": 258
          }
        ],
        "text": "Our Foam Barges are also called cloud ferries; these names refer to the same toy.\r\nFor Foam Barges, do not dispatch a parcel if the stamp is missing.\r\nDispatch with a stamp is conditional on the envelope being dry.\r\nP.S. A damp envelope may travel only inside a blue sleeve; this exception qualifies dispatch.\r\n"
      },
      {
        "spans": [
          {
            "end": 425,
            "source_id": "eval_river",
            "start": 353
          }
        ],
        "text": "A higher dryness rating means a lower blur tendency, not a higher one.\r\n"
      },
      {
        "spans": [
          {
            "end": 526,
            "source_id": "eval_river",
            "start": 425
          }
        ],
        "text": "One note calls the sleeve blue; a second calls its colour unknown. Do not resolve the disagreement.\r\n"
